From bee7256b3b89e6bc5cd48d3d452ca294541ee501 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Prakash Sanker <307704256+prakash-oai@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 15:28:53 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(plugins): add a metadata-only hook before turn
 dispatch

A plugin can need to save a record before the model or worker starts.
Await before_turn_start with the session ID and run ID after the turn
leaves the queue. An error or timeout stops dispatch and model fallback.

An operator can require one plugin by ID in the service environment.
Each dispatch then needs a successful call to that plugin, including
after a plugin reload.
