Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat(plugins): report committed session creation to
 listeners

Let a plugin subscribe to new session IDs through runtime.events.onSessionCreated. Publish the agent and session IDs after the store commits a creation or replaces a session ID. A listener can observe an empty session before the first turn.

Extend the Gateway test for repeated sessions.create calls to check that the listener receives one notification.
